{#- Why Pedlex (white). Data: c.why { eyebrow, title, cards[{ icon, title, text }],
    video { image, alt, title, label, placeholder? }, certifications { label, items[{ image, name }] } }.
    Raffi (2026-10-29): add the Pedlex company/team video. Phones: head, video, reasons. Desktop: the
    video frame (left) beside the head and four compact reasons (right); the certification strip
    closes the section. Grid areas in why.css place the three blocks.
    The video is a PLACEHOLDER until Pedlex supplies the film: a real Pedlex photo as the poster, a
    quiet decorative play mark with the dashed « vidéo à venir » tag right under it, so nobody expects
    it to play. Nothing is clickable yet.
    Styles: styles/sections/why.css -#}
{%- from "components/ui.njk" import sectionHead, featureCard -%}
<section class="section why" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="why__layout">
      {%- if c.why.video %}
      <figure class="why__video" data-reveal>
        <div class="media why__video-frame">
          {% picture c.why.video.image, c.why.video.alt, "(min-width: 64rem) 36rem, 100vw" %}
          <span class="why__play">
            <span class="why__play-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "play" %}</span>
            {%- if c.why.video.placeholder %}<span class="why__video-tag">{{ c.why.video.label | safe }}</span>{% endif %}
          </span>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="why__video-caption">{{ c.why.video.title | safe }}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      {%- endif %}
      <div class="why__head">
        {{ sectionHead(c.why.eyebrow, c.why.title, null, { id: "why-title", index: sectionIndex }) }}
      </div>
      <div class="why__list" data-reveal-stagger>
        {%- for card in c.why.cards %}
        {{ featureCard(card) }}
        {%- endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {%- if c.why.certifications %}
    <div class="why__certs" data-reveal>
      <p class="why__certs-label">{{ c.why.certifications.label | safe }}</p>
      <ul class="why__certs-list" role="list">
        {%- for item in c.why.certifications.items %}
        <li class="why__cert">{% picture item.image, item.name, "160px", { class: "why__cert-img" } %}</li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {%- endif %}
  </div>
</section>
